    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The &quot;Uses Clause Manager&quot; expert has some additional configuration options available from the GExperts configuration dialog: </text></para>
    <para styleclass=" " style="text-align:center; text-indent:0px; margin-top:30px; margin-right:0px; margin-bottom:24px; margin-left:0px; line-height:1.00; background-color:transparent; white-space:normal; page-break-inside:auto; page-break-after:auto; border:none; tabstops:none;"><image src="Uses Clause Manager Configuration.png" imagestyleclass="Default" scale="100.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"></image></para>
    <para styleclass=" " style="text-align:left; text-indent:0px; margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; line-height:1.00; background-color:transparent; white-space:normal; page-break-inside:auto; page-break-after:auto; border:none; tabstops:none;"><anchor id="Details" styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;"></anchor><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:16pt;" translate="true">   </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="SectionHeader" rowcount="1" colcount="2">
      <tr style="vertical-align:middle">
        <td style="height:24px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-left:6px; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;" translate="true">Details </text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40px; height:24px;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:right; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px;"><link displaytype="image" src="__Jump2Top.png" type="topiclink" href=""><title translate="true">Jump to top of page</title></link></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The following settings are available: </text></para>
    <list id="0" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Read project units from map file rather than  .dpr</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - If activated, the Project tab will be filled with units read from the project&apos;s map file. This requires that map file is being created.Turn this on in the linker setting in the project options. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="1" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Replace IDE file, Use Unit feature</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - The menu item </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Use Unit</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> in the file menu of the IDE will open the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Uses Clause Manager</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="2" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Parse all units, not just the Favorites</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - The parser that fills the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Identifier</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> page will not just read the units listed on the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Favorites</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> tab but all units in the search path. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="3" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <list id="3" level="1" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="o" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
        <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Disable Parser Cache</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - The parser will always run when the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Uses Clause Manager</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> expert is opened. Note, that filling the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Identifier</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> list will take much longer in this case. </text></li>
      </list>
    </list>
    <list id="4" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <list id="4" level="1" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="o" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
        <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Clear Cache</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Allows to clear the parser cache, forcing the parser to process all the files again next time the Uses Clause Manager expert is opened. </text></li>
      </list>
    </list>
    <list id="5" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Also search the favorites configured in the search path</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Refers to the favorites configured for the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Edit Path</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> expert (Delphi 2009 and later) and Search Path enhancement (all Delphi versions). </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="6" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Show identifiers matching search string ...</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Allows to preselect on of the three buttons in the Match filter at group box. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="7" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Default to Fast Add</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Sets the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Add fast</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> check mark in the expert&apos;s dialog. </text></li>
    </list>
